			"hadithnumber": 768,
			"arabicnumber": 768,
			"text": "Abdullah bin Shaqiq narrated:\"I asked Aishah about the Prophet's fasting.' She said: 'He would fast until we said: \"He has fasted\" and he would abstain from fasting until we said: \"He has abstained from fasting.\" (She said:) 'The Messenger of Allah did not fast an entire month except Ramadan",
